                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is an amazing idea! Love the way increase in speed changes the tempo of the music. My only qualm is with the movement mechanic. With no sensitivity option, as of yet, momentum can easily be lost when trying to change direction. I feel that initializing movement with A or something of the like might make it a little smoother. I will def be playing more of this and waiting to see how it grows :3",
